# Build output and local dependencies
**/target/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
*.tgz

# Local research and historical evidence are outside the public source tree.
/docs/
/plans/
/verification/
/comparisons/
/scripts/

# Benchmark databases, raw traces and plotting environment (reports remain tracked).
/benchmark/work/
/benchmark/raw/
/benchmark/logs/
/benchmark/.cache/
/benchmark/.venv/

# Local editor and environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
/PERFORMANCE_PLAN.md
*.md
!clients/php/README.md
!clients/c/crypto/README.md
!clients/lmdb-ulmdb/WINDOWS.md

# Keep the IPDon package's public API and recovery guide reviewable.
!crates/ulmdb-ipdon/README.md

# Keep the visual explorer's launch and navigation guide reviewable.
!utility/README.md
!utility/explorer/README.md

# Local explorer demo data is regenerated by its Rust example.
/utility/explorer/demo.ulmdb/

# Keep isolated lookup experiment methods and results reviewable.
!benchmark/lookup-strategies/README.md
!benchmark/lookup-strategies/*/README.md
!benchmark/lookup-strategies/results/REPORT.md
!benchmark/lookup-strategies/completed/**/*.md

# Local performance experiments and generated evidence.
/experiments/

# Keep the GitHub-facing snapshot-log benchmark report reviewable.
!benchmark/snapshot-log-20261108/REPORT.md
